\par 17/ H\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng Kho b\u7841\'3f}{\f1046\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2711886\charrsid10187646 c Nh\'e0 n\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2711886\charrsid10187646 \u7899\'3fc c\'f3 c\'e1c nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f:
\par 17.1- T\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc in v\'e0 b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn t\'edn phi\u7871\'3fu KBNN m\u7897\'3ft c\'e1ch ch\u7863\'3ft ch\u7869\'3f, an to\'e0n. L\u7853\'3fp k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ph\'e1t h\'e0nh t\'edn phi\u7871\'3fu v\'e0 chi tr\u7843
\'3f t\'edn phi\u7871\'3fu.
